{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.197.198.120","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c96bbef7767c3fe6f9fb5cb123af389","RawContent":"We are getting married June 14, 2016. I am needing ideas on what people do for their guest activities. \n\nIs everyone planning a welcome party? If so are you paying for private cocktail hour, or having everyone just meet at bar? We are wanting to do group excursion one day. Our group will range from 1-75 years old so not sure what will work for that range. \n\nAre you offering guests one paid activity and list of optional ones for other days that are non paid? I thought about putting list of local ideas from golf tee costs to snorkel in the oot packet so guests can pick their own.","Attachments":[],"Id":1907672,"PostDate":1447862008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married June 14, 2016. I am needing ideas on what people do for their guest activities. <br>\nIs everyone planning a welcome party? If so are you paying for private cocktail hour, or having everyone just meet at bar? We are wanting to do group excursion one day. Our group will range from 1-75 years old so not sure what will work for that range. <br>\nAre you offering guests one paid activity and list of optional ones for other days that are non paid? I thought about putting list of local ideas from golf tee costs to snorkel in the oot packet so guests can pick their own. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslietenille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440817494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1448663788","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LesTee","Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"4.53.94.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75f84f04156fe960aa6d763355b39be9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LesTee\" post=\"1907672\" timestamp=\"1447862008\"]\nWe are getting married June 14, 2016. I am needing ideas on what people do for their guest activities.\nIs everyone planning a welcome party? If so are you paying for private cocktail hour, or having everyone just meet at bar? We are wanting to do group excursion one day. Our group will range from 1-75 years old so not sure what will work for that range.\nAre you offering guests one paid activity and list of optional ones for other days that are non paid? I thought about putting list of local ideas from golf tee costs to snorkel in the oot packet so guests can pick their own.[\/quote]\nWe are hosting a private catamaran cruise (3 hours, open bar and snacks) on Friday.  Outside of that and the typical wedding stuff (ceremony, photos, reception), everyone is on their own.  \n\nWe made a list of potential excursions and put them on our website, but we are not offering to make arrangements for anything else.  It&#039;s too much to manage and we figured people wanted some time to do their own thing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1907714,"PostDate":1447960673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LesTee, on 18 November 2015 - 07:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are getting married June 14, 2016. I am needing ideas on what people do for their guest activities.<br>\nIs everyone planning a welcome party? If so are you paying for private cocktail hour, or having everyone just meet at bar? We are wanting to do group excursion one day. Our group will range from 1-75 years old so not sure what will work for that range.<br>\nAre you offering guests one paid activity and list of optional ones for other days that are non paid? I thought about putting list of local ideas from golf tee costs to snorkel in the oot packet so guests can pick their own.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are hosting a private catamaran cruise (3 hours, open bar and snacks) on Friday. \u00a0Outside of that and the typical wedding stuff (ceremony, photos, reception), everyone is on their own. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We made a list of potential excursions and put them on our website, but we are not offering to make arrangements for anything else. \u00a0It's too much to manage and we figured people wanted some time to do their own thing. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426945785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1447288455","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
