{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":751,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1833630,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1392341194,"LastPoster":{"Id":282291,"Name":"Beachgirl622","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282291.jpg?_r=1448667533","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1833630,"PostDate":1392341194,"PostContent":"This is a question for brides that did a legal ceremony in the DR. How long did it take you get y...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390772931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76362,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc9f1049daca9fa7eef945350ed2e398","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is a question for brides that did a legal ceremony in the DR. How long did it take you get your marriage certificate from the DR? We are trying to decide on a legal or symbolic ceremony and wanted to know which is easier.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833630,"PostDate":1392341194,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is a question for brides that did a legal ceremony in the DR. How long did it take you get your marriage certificate from the DR? We are trying to decide on a legal or symbolic ceremony and wanted to know which is easier.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390772931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.241.172.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76362,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b16dff34b802e2de59cc27fa1f34cbab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kellymiller\"] My bff was married in DR beginning of December. She just received it in the mail this week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833649,"PostDate":1392348137,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276338-kellymiller\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kellymiller<\/span><\/a> My bff was married in DR beginning of December. She just received it in the mail this week.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"csonnel@live.com","IpAddress":"99.241.172.74","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390342680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276245.jpg?_r=1391031473","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Csonnel","Id":276245,"Name":"Csonnel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.233.229.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76362,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6446ca6c356b44f03760aa15e0f45a6","RawContent":"I want to do a legal wedding as well. @[member=\"Csonnel\"] is your friend on BDW I would love to see how she went about it. I really need help with knowing what to do and who to contact. \n@[member=\"kellymiller\"], thanks for the great question.","Attachments":[],"Id":1833657,"PostDate":1392353561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I want to do a legal wedding as well. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276245\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276245-csonnel\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Csonnel<\/span><\/a> is your friend on BDW I would love to see how she went about it. I really need help with knowing what to do and who to contact. <br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276338-kellymiller\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kellymiller<\/span><\/a>, thanks for the great question. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Soon to be Mrs. Thiam ","Email":"timairee.s.sutton@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.233.229.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1376225647,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272458.jpg?_r=1389190783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DWBride2015","Id":272458,"Name":"DWBride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.241.172.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76362,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68dc438fde5bfeee11fab7c6c493090b","RawContent":"@[member=\"DWBride2015\"] she used to be on the site. Once we got back from her wedding she was unable to access her account. She&#039;s pretty upset as she posted all of her DIYs throughout the year leading up to her wedding:(","Attachments":[],"Id":1833724,"PostDate":1392406319,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272458\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/272458-dwbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DWBride2015<\/span><\/a> she used to be on the site. Once we got back from her wedding she was unable to access her account. She's pretty upset as she posted all of her DIYs throughout the year leading up to her wedding:(\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"csonnel@live.com","IpAddress":"99.241.172.74","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390342680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276245.jpg?_r=1391031473","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Csonnel","Id":276245,"Name":"Csonnel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.119.64.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76362,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3326245a1492200051463a57d9d6a393","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have read it can take up to six months.&amp;nbsp; That&#039;s why my FI and I decided to go with symbolic cermony.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1836064,"PostDate":1393629357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have read it can take up to six months.\u00a0 That's why my FI and I decided to go with symbolic cermony.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellis_baby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.222.71.55","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386903765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275607.jpg?_r=1425326341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellisbaby","Id":275607,"Name":"kellisbaby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76362,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa5438c09600c44d32f01b17cea08b8a","RawContent":"I&#039;m doing a symbolic as well for this reason","Attachments":[],"Id":1855637,"PostDate":1403007186,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm doing a symbolic as well for this reason  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"taryn_henderson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402952494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tarynh86","Id":278544,"Name":"tarynh86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.211.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76362,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"704c22c11a7c05d38860a0fa7d155a6b","RawContent":"Hi. \n\n\nIt&#039;s been a while since I&#039;ve been back on this site but since I was scrolling through I noticed this topic. Just a note to future brides, much of the marriage license will greatly depend on your coordinator as you already know.  My husband and I got married in PC in 11\/30\/13 and we had our license in hand by the end of the year.  I will say a huge part of that is the fact that our coordinator Carolina at GPPC was adamant that we scan\/ send her preliminary documents BEFORE sending copies via post. Why? Because there were some things that weren&#039;t done correctly.  She sent us back to the embassy and calling our own states offices a couple of times to make sure everything is perfect.\n\n\nI&#039;ve heard a few stories about delays, and while that doesn&#039;t mean the coordinators were clueless, these folks I know did not have the attn to detail from the coordinator and things were just sent in with a hope and a prayer.\n\n\nIt can take up to 6 months but I&#039;ve heard from those I know they received theirs in hand within 2 months. I thought the process was easy but after reviewing some of the things we had to do the most that caused the headaches were tiny mistakes. Hope this helps any future brides!","Attachments":[],"Id":1906060,"PostDate":1444316941,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi. <br><br>\nIt's been a while since I've been back on this site but since I was scrolling through I noticed this topic. Just a note to future brides, much of the marriage license will greatly depend on your coordinator as you already know.  My husband and I got married in PC in 11\/30\/13 and we had our license in hand by the end of the year.  I will say a huge part of that is the fact that our coordinator Carolina at GPPC was adamant that we scan\/ send her preliminary documents BEFORE sending copies via post. Why? Because there were some things that weren't done correctly.  She sent us back to the embassy and calling our own states offices a couple of times to make sure everything is perfect.<br><br>\nI've heard a few stories about delays, and while that doesn't mean the coordinators were clueless, these folks I know did not have the attn to detail from the coordinator and things were just sent in with a hope and a prayer.<br><br>\nIt can take up to 6 months but I've heard from those I know they received theirs in hand within 2 months. I thought the process was easy but after reviewing some of the things we had to do the most that caused the headaches were tiny mistakes. Hope this helps any future brides!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"valencia.gray@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.192.72.131","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359413112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265282.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride2B1130","Id":265282,"Name":"Bride2B1130","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.215.7.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76362,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3bce297e833a760ac2e0d25820841c3","RawContent":"I am having a hard time understanding exactly the documents I need for the legal wedding. \n\n\nI have our certified copied of birth certificates and know I need to get these translated into spanish. Do I get it translated at the dominican consulate?\n\n\nI also know that I need a single status affadavid signed before a notary and translated into spanish.  Do I need to create this document myself or where can I find it?\n\n\nThen I saw something about needing an apostille. Does anyone know anything about this!\n\n\nHELP","Attachments":[],"Id":1906071,"PostDate":1444335541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am having a hard time understanding exactly the documents I need for the legal wedding. <br><br>\nI have our certified copied of birth certificates and know I need to get these translated into spanish. Do I get it translated at the dominican consulate?<br><br>\nI also know that I need a single status affadavid signed before a notary and translated into spanish.  Do I need to create this document myself or where can I find it?<br><br>\nThen I saw something about needing an apostille. Does anyone know anything about this!<br><br>\nHELP\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"akutch23@gmail.com","IpAddress":"32.213.186.230","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425254163,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282291.jpg?_r=1448667533","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Beachgirl622","Id":282291,"Name":"Beachgirl622","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"76362","Title":"How Long Does It Take To Get Your Marriage Licence From The Dr?","LastPostDate":1444335541},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
